course: dictionary
lesson: 4592
title: Herbal: made from plants
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «Herbal» describes something made from herbs or plants. Herbal tea is a drink made from plants, and herbal shampoo is made with plant ingredients. Look at the words next to it to check: a herbal tea is made with plants, not with tea leaves.
explain: Look at the clue words around it. «Some medicines interact, making each other stronger or weaker, so doctors and pharmacists need to know about every medicine and herbal remedy a person takes.» Herbal remedy sits in the same list as medicine, so a herbal remedy is a kind of medicine.
explain: Be careful: herbal does not mean safe. «Natural does not mean safe: some herbal remedies can harm, or interact with other medicines.» Swap your meaning into the sentence: "Plant-made does not mean safe" still makes sense, so the meaning fits.
explain: «Fruit and herbal teas are not really tea, just other plants in hot water.» Here the word tells you the drink comes from plants, not from the tea plant. If you are not sure, ask a pharmacist, the medicines expert at the chemist's.
fact: Herbal means made from herbs or plants, as in «herbal tea».
fact: A «herbal remedy» is a medicine made from plants.
fact: Herbal does not always mean safe: «Natural does not mean safe.»
fact: «Herbal» can also be a noun, meaning an old book that describes plants and their uses.
fact: Ask a pharmacist, the medicines expert at the chemist's, before you take a herbal pill.
exercise: «Fruit and herbal teas are not really tea, just other plants in hot water.» What does herbal mean here? | Made from milk | Made from sugar | Made from tea leaves | *Made from plants
exercise: Sam says, «Natural means safe, so herbal pills are fine.» What is wrong with what Sam says? | *Plant medicines can harm you or interact with other medicines | Herbal means the same as tea | Nothing is wrong | Pills are always made from sugar
exercise: «A herbal» in an old library most likely means what? | A kind of pharmacist | *An old book that describes plants and their uses | A plant that grows in water | A shop that sells shampoo
test: Herbal shampoo is made with what kind of ingredients? | Stone ingredients | Metal ingredients | *Plant ingredients
test: «Some medicines interact.» Why must doctors know about every herbal remedy a person takes? | Because doctors like old books | *Because it can change how other medicines work | Because herbal remedies are always safe | Because herbal remedies taste bad
exam: Which sentence best shows that herbal does not always mean safe? | «The herbal book is old.» | «Fruit teas are not really tea.» | «Herbal tea is warm and nice.» | *«Herbal pills can affect the body like other medicines and can do harm.»
